{"unit_id":"DevourerM__dsh-naiwa-theme#feature-1","repo":"DevourerM/dsh-naiwa-theme","commit":"e25421d9247aceecdc97852091991708a5897df0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-naiwa-theme 的功能「双模式奶蛙配色」：为 DSH Web 覆盖背景、品牌色、文字、侧栏和输入区主题令牌，并分别定义浅色与深色值。安装并载入主题后自动生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.template.js:15-45","src/client.template.js:265-270"]}
