{"unit_id":"DevourerM__dsh-naiwa-theme#feature-3","repo":"DevourerM/dsh-naiwa-theme","commit":"e25421d9247aceecdc97852091991708a5897df0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-naiwa-theme 的功能「输入区与背景美化」：为聊天输入卡片和发送按钮添加配色、图案与悬停样式，并在 shell.overlay 浮层展示半身奶蛙背景图。浮层不接收鼠标事件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.template.js:47-67","src/client.template.js:273-277","styles/theme.css:64-73","styles/theme.css:94-124"]}
{"unit_id":"DevourerM__dsh-naiwa-theme#feature-4","repo":"DevourerM/dsh-naiwa-theme","commit":"e25421d9247aceecdc97852091991708a5897df0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-naiwa-theme 的功能「会话声音反馈」：订阅会话列表状态，在顶层会话开始运行时播放短音效、完成时播放笑声音效并触发短暂庆祝动画；子代理状态变化会被忽略。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.template.js:210-260"]}
